{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Because he has despised the word of YHWH.</b> This refers to one who acts with a high hand." "<b>And has broken His commandment.</b> For He commanded him not to act with a high hand. And some say: or if he breaks His commandment in secret." "<b>That soul.</b> It is not the intellect, as the words of one led astray by spirit, but rather it is the joining of the soul with the body." "<b>Her iniquity is in her.</b> Like \"his blood is on his own head.\""], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:51.532166869Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}